<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text">Nexus</span>: Taming Throughput-Latency Tradeoff in LLM Serving via Efficient GPU Sharing</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
