<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F8.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S4.F8.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Naive asynchronous solution.</span></figcaption>
