</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>. </span><span id="S6.F11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <span id="S6.F11.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Offline Inference.</span> Run on a single
L20 under Long Data Collections and Mixed Workloads with
3B and 8B models repsectively. X means timeout. All systems use a single L20 GPU, except vLLM-P/D with two.</span></figcaption>
